      "text": "For the purpose of keeping a clear record, Nora Vale submitted the draft on 3 May 2025, and Omar Bell reviewed it on 7 May 2025. Omar Bell did not approve the draft. The treatment may reduce pain at 12 mg; it has not been shown to improve sleep. The team tested the device, and energy use fell by 8 %. The report [Vale, 2025] states \"The findings are uncertain\". Further information is available at https://example.org/trial. The purpose of this note is to communicate these observations in a clear way.",
